d87fe0bff88b5dbf77d72c75e6b88e23f21a49","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"04433c9d6f4ebf1ff375e64f295f3707515df1b5af14c3a6aca71ec603b10a94","logical_entry_identity":"e947e796e2ef84c07e04fd6c04813374559024daad93c7d3227e7318bd9c69de","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Infuse your two handed weapon with light while spinning around.\n\t\tAll creatures in radius one take %d%% weapon damage.\n\t\tIn addition while spinning your weapon shines so much it deals %d%% light weapon damage to all foes in radius 2.\n\t\tAt level 4 your spinning blade creates a shield that blocks all damage for 1 turn.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"旋转一周，同时将光明之力充满武器。\n\t\t半径 1 以内的敌人将受到 %d%% 武器伤害，同时半径 2 以内的敌人将受到 %d%% 光系武器伤害。\n\t\t技能等级 4 或以上时，在旋转时你会制造一层护盾，吸收 1 回合内的所有攻击。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"953a00b4b95f198756896de264db0dcd1080c7ce8707bdaa90fd888c4455f4ba","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"04484e4cf6d86e09dbe26ac001e29561d95b29505607540205225bb59d0b6f6e","logical_entry_identity":"adc2d758196439fc6b5043391833d2fc2084555919bb9ed87b8a97071deab007","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#Target# is marked for death!","source_tag":"_t","target":"#Target#被死亡标记！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"176ee6865cd59b74eeda99bc76ce6ee1e044e9b76edb0ca1a66afe2541ccab39","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"045046a5d8362e4b3347659303d7ba6340791e00dcd6e8e15de2171fe48a45b9","logical_entry_identity":"02384f2556cf3be6c2deb987195df266109161a4abad9a69c64ac2bbc0936601","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#Target# starts regenerating health quickly.","source_tag":"_t","target":"#Target#开始快速回复生命值。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"6b79378ee66d8467110265e0d519a4e2dc292fdea5ab7d054cb05d607ea3e817","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"0450bcd3fa74ffddbffd34d42120e2e8e7d7a2d8188874733c41d60637bb9d97","logical_entry_identity":"cb4465ab18dba76cb1be8753f8cab5a701a800b61ed443e89f9954100549dc65","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"As any scryer knows, the link between the murderer and the murdered is the murder weapon, and a scryer can follow that link from the murdered to the weapon to the murderer.\nOne rather cold blooded killer thought of a way around this. By carving blades out of ice, they could kill as they wished and the link would just melt away.\nTheir killing spree ended when one of the victims got lucky and managed to stab the murderer in the heart with the icey blade. After being united with the cold heart that created it, the final ice blade has never melted.","source_tag":"_t","target":"任何占卜师都知道，凶器乃是缉查凶手最重要的线索；他们往往顺着这条线索顺藤摸瓜，从人群中找出凶手的真身。\n然而，一个冷酷的杀手找到了一个办法：他用寒冰铸成了一把利刃，将其刺入受害者的胸口，让其随着受害者心脏的体温渐渐融化，消失于无形。\n最终，这名杀手仍然没有逍遥于法外。一名受害者幸运地夺下了利刃，反身刺入了杀手的心脏里。杀手冷酷的内心没有温度，而这把与其相融的利刃从此再也不会融化。"}],"fixed_source_identity":"commit:624a67329fe2ad440c5b344785a9c73fcf22ae63","rendered_briefing":"WP2-Lite surface screen; review only","rules_version":"production-review-v2-lite-rules-v2","terminology_snapshot":"9c5578a9655e6dd80db73e1cd996c97dce1bee4abd5e219636a19c81f80a7672"}}